          "sentence": "Following a standard period of leak checks and pressurization, the hatches connecting the Dragon and space station were opened at 9:19 p.m. ET, allowing the new arrivals to enter the ISS, NASA said in its most recent blog post.",
          "occurrence_id": "occurrence-1d75469bfff940720633a831c1cd404a6e231e2aea2f68fef95561ec70857d96-42907156968570b7"
